// FEAT-07: SHA-256 Multi-Block Streaming API
// Context layout (128 bytes):
//   [0..31]  : h0..h7 (je int64, nur lower 32 Bits genutzt)
//   [64..71] : total bytes processed (int64)
//   [72]     : buffer fill level (int64)
